The previous event-ordering regression passes my independent checks for both admitted and unknown retry outcomes, including after remount. I found another recovery defect: Rust drops old transcript entries at its limits, but the UI uses the visible operator-message count as a baseline. At 200 entries, a delivered message can remain “Not confirmed” even while it is visible in the transcript. I reproduced this with the production component and store; both snapshots passed the wire parser.
